<title>SRI LANKA: Vanik up on growth prospects.</title>
<headline>Vanik up on growth prospects.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment bank Vanik Incorporation Ltd rose 6.7 percent, or one rupee to 16 rupees, on local retail buying of 35,000 shares, brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Investors expect improved results in the quarter to September 30,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The share was also cheap and liquid, making it an ideal retail buy, he said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsrooom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
